*> PLB-C112 varying-step-zero: PERFORM VARYING steps BY an item that
*> is always 0.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. STEPZERO.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-I                PIC S9(4) VALUE 0.
01  WS-J                PIC S9(4) VALUE 0.
01  WS-STEP             PIC S9(4) VALUE ZERO.
01  WS-INC              PIC 9(2) VALUE 00.
01  WS-ONE              PIC S9(4) VALUE 1.
01  WS-SET-LATER        PIC S9(4) VALUE 0.
01  WS-STEPS.
    05  WS-IN-GROUP     PIC S9(4) VALUE 0.
01  WS-SHARED           PIC S9(4) VALUE 0.
01  WS-SHARED-X REDEFINES WS-SHARED PIC X(4).
01  WS-TOTAL            PIC S9(8) VALUE 0.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    *> Reported: VALUE ZERO and VALUE 00, never changed.
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY WS-STEP UNTIL WS-I > 10
        ADD 1 TO WS-TOTAL
    END-PERFORM
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 3
            AFTER WS-J FROM 1 BY WS-INC UNTIL WS-J > 3
        ADD 1 TO WS-TOTAL
    END-PERFORM
    *> Not reported: a step of 1, one a MOVE sets, one in a group a
    *> MOVE sets, and one a REDEFINES shares.
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY WS-ONE UNTIL WS-I > 10
        ADD 1 TO WS-TOTAL
    END-PERFORM
    MOVE 2 TO WS-SET-LATER
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY WS-SET-LATER UNTIL WS-I > 10
        ADD 1 TO WS-TOTAL
    END-PERFORM
    MOVE ALL "1" TO WS-STEPS
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY WS-IN-GROUP UNTIL WS-I > 10
        ADD 1 TO WS-TOTAL
    END-PERFORM
    MOVE "0001" TO WS-SHARED-X
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY WS-SHARED UNTIL WS-I > 10
        ADD 1 TO WS-TOTAL
    END-PERFORM
    DISPLAY WS-TOTAL
    STOP RUN.
